<title>USA: Indiana/Ohio direct hogs $0.50 higher - USDA.</title>
<headline>Indiana/Ohio direct hogs $0.50 higher - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were $0.50 higher. Demand moderate on a moderate to light movement. Top $58.00 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>			     Country			 Plant</p>
<p>US 1-2   230-260 lbs.  56.00-57.00, few 57.50    56.50-58.00</p>
<p>US 2-3   230-260 lbs.  50.50-56.00</p>
<p>	   210-230 lbs.  46.00-50.50</p>
<p>Sows:  Steady. Top 47.50.</p>
<p>US 1-3   300-400 lbs.  41.50-42.50</p>
<p>	   400-500 lbs.  42.00-44.00, few 45.00</p>
<p>	   500-600 lbs.  44.00-46.00, few 46.50</p>
<p>few over 600 lbs.  47.00-47.50</p>
</text>
